6
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:55,400
You must not, Riko. If you end up helpless like this as well, then it's over. Please, just let me be...

7
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,400
Nanachi!

8
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:01,540
Forgive me. I'm sorry. I'm fine staying here with Midi.

9
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:14,920
There's no way this is fine! Nanachi! Nanachi! Let's head to the bottom of the netherworld! Alone with Midi! Come on! Wake up, Nanachi! You can't do this! Come on! Nanachi!

