This transparent one is a male.

270
00:18:16,742 --> 00:18:17,742
Ow!

271
00:18:17,742 --> 00:18:18,742
Ooh!

272
00:18:18,742 --> 00:18:22,742
They gather together and move around as a group in order to hunt.

273
00:18:22,742 --> 00:18:28,742
But since the queen is dead, the remaining ones have divided up and left to create a new one.

274
00:18:28,742 --> 00:18:29,742
So well done!

275
00:18:29,742 --> 00:18:30,742
Good job!

276
00:18:30,742 --> 00:18:31,742
Honey!

277
00:18:31,742 --> 00:18:36,742
If you knew that already, then you should have told us before now, okay?

278
00:18:36,742 --> 00:18:38,742
Well, everyone loves a festival.

279
00:18:38,742 --> 00:18:41,742
After all, the villagers can't leave this place.

280
00:18:41,742 --> 00:18:42,742
See?

281
00:18:42,742 --> 00:18:43,742
Just look at that.

282
00:18:43,742 --> 00:18:45,742
All those satisfied faces.

283
00:18:45,742 --> 00:18:50,742
So, um, if you know, please tell me.

284
00:18:50,742 --> 00:18:53,742
Is there any way to get Nanachi back from that other sage?

285
00:18:53,742 --> 00:18:55,742
Hmm, let's see.

286
00:18:55,742 --> 00:19:00,742
If you could get even just a part of Fopta, the embodiment of value, perhaps...

287
00:19:00,742 --> 00:19:01,742
Fopta?

288
00:19:01,742 --> 00:19:02,742
Meh.

289
00:19:02,742 --> 00:19:04,742
I doubt that's possible, though.

290
00:19:04,742 --> 00:19:05,742
Good luck!

291
00:19:05,742 --> 00:19:17,742
So wait, Nanachi is stuck there and can't leave?

292
00:19:17,742 --> 00:19:23,742
Belov told us that in order to make a trade, we would need value that was equal or greater to that of a human child.

293
00:19:23,742 --> 00:19:24,742
We need Fopta.

294
00:19:24,742 --> 00:19:27,742
Um, so, Reg, what's Fopta like, anyway?

295
00:19:27,742 --> 00:19:31,742
We met and had a talk of sorts, but I don't know much.

296
00:19:31,742 --> 00:19:35,742
Riko, I should probably leave and find Fopta again.

297
00:19:36,742 --> 00:19:40,742
I'm not sure how it'll turn out, but we won't get anywhere like this.

298
00:19:43,742 --> 00:19:44,742
Hey, Riko?

299
00:19:44,742 --> 00:19:46,742
What exactly is Fopta?

300
00:19:48,742 --> 00:19:54,742
The embodiment of value and the thing we all most desire, but also we most fear.

301
00:19:54,742 --> 00:19:55,742
You most fear?

302
00:19:55,742 --> 00:19:56,742
What do you mean?

303
00:19:56,742 --> 00:19:58,742
Well, you see...

304
00:19:58,742 --> 00:20:00,742
Wait, first of all.

305
00:20:00,742 --> 00:20:03,742
Who in the world are you supposed to be?

306
00:20:03,742 --> 00:20:04,742
You know what?

307
00:20:04,742 --> 00:20:09,742
A long time's passed since I found myself here, and I've never once seen you before.

308
00:20:09,742 --> 00:20:12,742
Because I never smell you before.

309
00:20:12,742 --> 00:20:16,742
Hey, um, so, Mugi, Riko is the one from Dogupu who I...

310
00:20:16,742 --> 00:20:19,742
Uh, sorry, it's fine.

311
00:20:19,742 --> 00:20:24,742
It's just that, if they catch me, I'll never be able to tell my story, right?

312
00:20:24,742 --> 00:20:28,742
I am one of the survivors of the Suicide Squad Ganja.

313
00:20:28,742 --> 00:20:33,742
We went on an expedition in search of the Golden City in the depths of the Netherworld.

314
00:20:33,742 --> 00:20:36,742
I was in charge of managing relics and the health of our companions.

315
00:20:36,742 --> 00:20:41,742
My name is Vuedo Errico, and I was one of the three sages.

316
00:20:41,742 --> 00:20:44,742
You wanted to know more about Fopta, right?

317
00:20:44,742 --> 00:20:45,742
Please!

318
00:20:45,742 --> 00:20:52,742
I've honestly never had an audience with the princess, but I know their desires, and what it is they want most of all.

319
00:20:52,742 --> 00:20:57,742
If I tell you everything that I know, there's probably no turning back from it, Riko.

320
00:20:57,742 --> 00:21:03,742
I'm not the type to say I don't wanna, or else I wouldn't be here!

321
00:21:03,742 --> 00:21:10,742
First of all, they say that time here is out of sync with the rest of the outside world,

322
00:21:10,742 --> 00:21:14,742
so I'm not exactly sure how long ago this would be in terms of your own time.

323
00:21:14,742 --> 00:21:23,742
I don't know if you sent these children.

324
00:21:23,742 --> 00:21:29,742
That boy must be what you talked about, a true resident of the Golden City.

325
00:21:29,742 --> 00:21:33,742
So, Idomyui, did you see it?

326
00:21:33,742 --> 00:21:44,742
The way Wazukyan's face looked, he can still get that scared, huh?

327
00:21:46,742 --> 00:21:58,742
My dear Idomyui, your existence, your desires, your memories, the time has now come to dredge all that up.

328
00:23:30,034 --> 00:24:00,014
Thank you.

